{"2769580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tactical Warfare: Siege Survival", "steam_appid": 2769580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Get the Full Game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Dive into the captivating world of Tactical Warfare, a mini-game packed with intense action and strategic depth. In this thrilling experience, you'll face off against relentless waves of enemies, tasked with defending your base at all costs.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>Engaging Gameplay: Test your strategic skills as you fortify your base and fend off enemy assaults.<br>Dynamic Challenges: Adapt to changing enemy tactics and environmental conditions to secure victory.<br>Resource Management: Carefully manage resources to maintain your defenses and withstand the toughest waves.<br>Tactical Warfare offers a taste of the full gaming experience, providing hours of immersive gameplay and challenging scenarios. Wishlist now to secure your spot in the upcoming playtest and gain full access to the game on November 29, 2024!<br><br>Wishlist Tactical Warfare and prepare to unleash your tactical prowess!", "about_the_game": "Dive into the captivating world of Tactical Warfare, a mini-game packed with intense action and strategic depth. In this thrilling experience, you'll face off against relentless waves of enemies, tasked with defending your base at all costs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEngaging Gameplay: Test your strategic skills as you fortify your base and fend off enemy assaults.<br />\r\nDynamic Challenges: Adapt to changing enemy tactics and environmental conditions to secure victory.<br />\r\nResource Management: Carefully manage resources to maintain your defenses and withstand the toughest waves.<br />\r\nTactical Warfare offers a taste of the full gaming experience, providing hours of immersive gameplay and challenging scenarios. Wishlist now to secure your spot in the upcoming playtest and gain full access to the game on November 29, 2024!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWishlist Tactical Warfare and prepare to unleash your tactical prowess!", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in Tactical Warfare, a captivating mini-game of the base game where you defend your base against relentless enemy waves. Strategize, fortify, and survive to emerge victorious. Wishlist now for exclusive access to the playtest and full game on November 29, 2024!.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769580/header.jpg?t=1721787060", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1721787060", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1721787060", "website": "https://www.mizrab.co/rtstacticalwarefare", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit | Windows 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6300U or AMD Ryzen 5 2400G | CPU with AVX support required<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3050 GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit | Windows 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.6 GHz 6-core (Intel i5) or AMD Ryzen 5 1600 | CPU with AVX support required<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 4060 GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</s